---
import LegalLayout from "@/layouts/legal-layout.astro";
import { LINKS } from "@/constants/links";
import { SPONSOR_PORTAL_URL } from "@/constants/sponsors";
---

<LegalLayout
  id="refunds"
  heading="Refund policy"
  title="Refund Policy"
  description="Cancellation and refund policy for Shadcn Labs sponsorships."
  updated="October 6, 2026"
>
  <p>
    Sponsorships are monthly subscriptions sold through Dodo Payments, our
    merchant of record. Approved refunds are issued by Dodo Payments to your
    original payment method.
  </p>

  <h3>Cancelling</h3>
  <p>
    Cancel at any time from the <a
      href={SPONSOR_PORTAL_URL}
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener">Dodo Payments customer portal</a
    >, or by emailing <a
      href={`mailto:${LINKS.EMAIL}`}>{LINKS.EMAIL}</a
    >. Cancellation stops future renewals; your placements stay live until the
    end of the period you already paid for.
  </p>

  <h3>When you get a full refund</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>
      You ask within 7 days of your first payment and your placements have not
      gone live yet.
    </li>
    <li>You were charged more than once for the same period.</li>
    <li>
      We cannot deliver the perks of your tier, or we remove your sponsorship
      under our terms (in that case, for the unused part of the period).
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h3>When we do not refund</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Partial months after your placements have gone live. Cancel before the
      next renewal instead.
    </li>
    <li>Renewals you did not cancel before the renewal date.</li>
    <li>Results such as traffic, clicks, or conversions being lower than hoped.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>How to ask</h3>
  <p>
    Email <a href={`mailto:${LINKS.EMAIL}`}>{LINKS.EMAIL}</a> with the email you
    paid with and your invoice or subscription ID. We reply within 3 business
    days, and approved refunds usually reach you within 5–10 business days,
    depending on your bank. Please contact us before opening a chargeback; we
    resolve most issues faster that way.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
